      <title>350台绝唱：特斯拉Model S/X签名版交付，弗里蒙特工厂的时代更迭与价值重塑</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20260422-350%E5%8F%B0%E7%BB%9D%E5%94%B1%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89model-sx%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E7%89%88%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E5%BC%97%E9%87%8C%E8%92%99%E7%89%B9%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E6%9B%B4%E8%BF%AD%E4%B8%8E%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E9%87%8D%E5%A1%91/</link>
